config BR2_PACKAGE_TINYTAG_DETECT
    bool "tinytag_detect"
    select BR2_PACKAGE_GSL_LITE
    select BR2_PACKAGE_COMMON
    select BR2_PACKAGE_DISPLAY
    select BR2_PACKAGE_APRILTAG
    select BR2_PACKAGE_K230_OSD
    help
        AprilTag detector using a small neural network (TinyTag) to propose
        candidate tag ROIs, then the standard AprilTag C library to decode
        each ROI crop -- see experimental/tinytag-v4c and
        experimental/tinytag-v6 (HEADS_AND_POSTPROCESSING.md) in the repo
        root for the model and its training-side design notes.

        Only the trained heatmap/offset/scale channels (0-4 of the kmodel's
        21-channel output) are used; corner/visibility channels (5-20) are
        untrained and deliberately ignored.
